{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026eoy6FhOIKW1793457723.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>萬聖節前夕，中環蘭桂坊越夜越熱鬧。</p><p></p><p>由於人潮太多，警方晚上九時許，一度將人流引導至中環交易廣場對出的干諾道中，再繞一圈回到畢打街，轉入皇后大道中，再沿路往蘭桂坊。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.HALLOWEEN.OUTSIDE-2200_001.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/20266GqYFBzx1k1793457852.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>港鐵中環站部分出入口，因應人潮管制要暫時關閉。</p><p></p><p>由於蘭桂坊都實施單向人潮管制，大批人離開蘭桂坊後，沿雪廠街返回皇后大道中。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-01T04:05:35.822283+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":143,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-31T14:40:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-01T03:59:26.115317+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-01T03:59:26.115317+00:00","content_hash":"16922f7bcc04a579b416b3cb1e40b027c708ae2b4a1853cde2e3b4c5aeca6c75","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}